---
source: crates/paper-cli/tests/basics.rs
expression: env.redact(&run.stderr)
---
error: Paper doesn't know who you are yet
  why:  Every save records its author, and no name or email is set in your paper settings or your git configuration.
  next: paper config set user.name "Your Name"            # set the name saves are made under
        paper config set user.email you@example.org       # set your email address
        git config --global user.name "Your Name"         # or set the name in your git configuration instead
        git config --global user.email "you@example.org"  # or set the email in your git configuration instead
